        <guid>https://producthunt.programnotes.cn/en/p/telegram-search/</guid>
        <description>&lt;img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1726161113123-98d414829399?ixid=M3w0NjAwMjJ8MHwxfHJhbmRvbXx8fHx8fHx8fDE3NDg0MTcyOTd8&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0" alt="Featured image of post telegram-search" /&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;groupultratelegram-search&#34;&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/groupultra/telegram-search&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;groupultra/telegram-search&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;telegram-search&#34;&gt;Telegram Search
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./README_EN.md&#34; &gt;English&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./getting-started.md&#34; &gt;快速开始&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://t.me/&amp;#43;Gs3SH2qAPeFhYmU9&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://img.shields.io/badge/Telegram-2CA5E0?style=for-the-badge&amp;amp;logo=telegram&amp;amp;logoColor=white&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Telegram&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/NzYsmJSgCT&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://dcbadge.limes.pink/api/server/NzYsmJSgCT&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Discord&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://trendshift.io/repositories/13868&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://trendshift.io/api/badge/repositories/13868&#34; alt=&#34;groupultra%2Ftelegram-search | Trendshift&#34; style=&#34;width: 250px; height: 55px;&#34; width=&#34;250&#34; height=&#34;55&#34;/&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;一个功能强大的 Telegram 聊天记录搜索工具，支持向量搜索和语义匹配。基于 OpenAI 的语义向量技术，让你的 Telegram 消息检索更智能、更精准。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;欢迎 PR 贡献！&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;由于项目处于快速迭代阶段，可能会出现数据库不兼容的情况，建议定期备份数据。&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-赞助者&#34;&gt;💖 赞助者
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://github.com/luoling8192/luoling8192/raw/master/sponsorkit/sponsors.svg&#34;
	
	
	
	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;Sponsors&#34;
	
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;-快速开始&#34;&gt;🚀 快速开始
